# Learning

## Project manifest

Read **`.arlox/project.json`** at the workspace root before naming modules, routes, or DB objects.

## After adding a feature

1. Pass stack verify (`make test`).
2. API shape lives in **`contracts/<feature>.md`** (workspace root) — not in `learned/`.
3. Run **`.cursor/skills/learn/SKILL.md`** (mandatory) and append to **`learned/README.md`**.

## Gated learning

- Before changing core files (`internal/server/`, shared middleware), read `learned/README.md`.
- Before cross-stack work, read `contracts/` and `.arlox/project.json`.

## Learned index

`.cursor/skills/add-feature-backend/learned/README.md` — implementation patterns and gotchas only.

Mark promoted patterns with `**Applied:** YYYY-MM-DD — <what changed>`.  
Check pending entries with `arlox skills status`.
